    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Vegetable samosas use a thin, crisp "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "samosa pastry",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "samosa-pastry"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " filled with spiced mashed potato and peas. The dough needs to rest so the gluten relaxes enough to roll thin without springing back. First-time folders should not worry about perfect symmetry: the seal is what matters, not the shape."
          }
        ]
      },
